      <activity id="2c394d86-3e23-5953-8889-533f98bf04af" activityNameId="3adf20d3-1c05-5e67-95e2-c379eaacbf49" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Fuel elements PWR, UO2 3.9% &amp; MOX, at nuclear fuel fabrication plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Fuel elements PWR, UO2 3.9% &amp; MOX, at nuclear fuel fabrication plant
The shares express the equilibrium between all plutonium in UO2 fuel elements at final discharge from the reactor and MOX use, hypothesizing that this reflects the situation in UCTE countries in the long term. The indication of data validity inputted in "TimePeriod" only says that the shares represent the knowledge available today of the likely fuel management for the UCTE light water reactors.;
UUID: 3745932b-bacb-3289-8d98-95bc0a562824
The module consists of the share of UO2 and MOX fuel elements.
Location: UCTE conditions
Technology: Data reflects the use of UO2 and MOX fuel elements in current nuclear reactors.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3745932b-bacb-3289-8d98-95bc0a562824.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
